{
  "info": {
    "name": "Pathfinder Functional Backend API",
    "description": "This is the complete API collection for the Pathfinder Functional Backend project. It includes endpoints for Maps, Obstacles, Waypoints, Route calculation, and Users.\n\n### Usage\n1. Import this collection and the associated `pathfinder-local.postman_environment.json` into Postman.\n2. Ensure the **Pathfinder Local** environment is selected in the top right corner.\n3. Run the **Health Check** first to verify connectivity.\n\n*Note: Route distance is currently computed via a Manhattan distance placeholder pending Phase 5B algorithm implementation.*\n\nDate generated: **2026-07-22**.\n\nAssignment 7.4 - Filters, Accumulators and Memoization\n\nThe Validation folder contains additional requests\ndemonstrating:\n- Filters: filterValidWaypoints, filterValidMapInput.\n- Accumulators: reachability check, all-routes count,\n  optimal route selection via pipe of reduce operations.\n- Memoization: complex geometry and large map validation\n  use memoized pathfinding to cache repeated calculations.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
